 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_4aca2fcdd1d00afcb20c",
   "sourceHash": "4aca2fcdd1d00afcb20ca31fb3bbd84ff5d8091392630b90c6580673657359a5",
   "text": "本条款与条件（以下简称“本条款”）适用于您对我们服务的使用，包括预订、阿育吠陀治疗、住宿、网站访问及相关服务。当您确认预订、在本院办理入住或使用我们的任何服务，即表示您已阅读、理解并同意本条款。如您不同意本条款，请勿使用我们的服务。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7d771bb8b342ad911fe5",
   "sourceHash": "7d771bb8b342ad911fe554f60e03b856b745caed51abda3bad6b629c0b6958b3",
   "text": "定义与术语",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_26bcb948a99aa8401b45",
   "sourceHash": "26bcb948a99aa8401b4523738a0f4db4831e0ee696f1c353d4584659a8eb39c8",
   "text": "“入住者”或“您”指任何进行预订、在本院住宿，或参加我们治疗或活动的个人。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Defined term 'Guest' rendered as 入住者 (person staying) instead of a 'guest' equivalent, per the language lock; legal definition scope unchanged."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93c1946b0ca1a4c0b72c",
   "sourceHash": "93c1946b0ca1a4c0b72ca6bd32708692960ce5e66357db71fe9dd6758ba43958",
   "text": "“院区”指位于喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德的 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 场所，包括住宿、治疗中心、用餐区、休闲设施及其他相关服务。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfb7b7bbe1404ba8458b",
   "sourceHash": "cfb7b7bbe1404ba8458b0ce0dcced7c6af43a47552bceaa7acdbb9a4ce3a51e3",
   "text": "“服务”包括 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 提供的所有阿育吠陀治疗、疗法、健康问诊、住宿预订、餐饮、活动及任何其他附加服务。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b5e229b82aaec4925614",
   "sourceHash": "b5e229b82aaec4925614d616d00071cbfb60fa0a4f321cd6b14f1798d932675a",
   "text": "使用资格",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4e0d93cf6757a751d7c2",
   "sourceHash": "4e0d93cf6757a751d7c257f14f610f0711d7fa8fd5135f51f08b65b18e3e4a4c",
   "text": "您必须年满18岁或达到您所在司法管辖区的法定成年年龄，方可进行预订或使用我们的服务。未成年人（18岁以下）须由父母或监护人陪同，并由其对未成年人的行为及遵守本条款的情况承担全部责任。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe135ac982315eae0127",
   "sourceHash": "fe135ac982315eae01270d5d1ebe59cc22cb53b48dee922fa217af3e2428039a",
   "text": "预订与预约政策",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e277cf2d81dbd54c4f2a",
   "sourceHash": "e277cf2d81dbd54c4f2aa1bc8f2b014dd4b2de6549b3f5d90a18e62b031234d8",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]预订确认：[[CLOSE_1]]支付40%订金即可确保预订；余款须不迟于入院前30天付清。如需指定别墅，须至少提前六个月提出申请，视房源情况而定；确认须支付全款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b87c644235196cc03012",
   "sourceHash": "b87c644235196cc03012e322c1fde8f89854a29522775e67dfb71d1ddcd82be6",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]预先要求：[[CLOSE_1]]为确保治疗与安排合适，我们可能会要求您提供额外信息，例如身份证明文件或健康资料。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_45d16de7a911499684c1",
   "sourceHash": "45d16de7a911499684c127ec4340296b28991ea1267e4b441db7c1107f0f752b",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]儿童政策：[[CLOSE_1]]5岁以下儿童与成人同住一室并使用现有床铺时，可免费住宿和用餐。较大儿童或加床可能需要额外收费。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1fbbfac2c69d4f3ccf72",
   "sourceHash": "1fbbfac2c69d4f3ccf725762ee846731922201d349dac8d1354fa57bdd99a763",
   "text": "医生问诊时间",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_51d090fa7cbe1a18c9ec",
   "sourceHash": "51d090fa7cbe1a18c9ecff7ffce0c474d5818a8c5c5e4f632b1939bfda37cb7e",
   "text": "当天预订或未经预约直接到达的入住者，须在3:30 PM之前办理入住，方可于当天接受医生问诊。设定此截止时间，是为了让我们的阿育吠陀医生能够提供细致、从容的问诊。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 入住者 (persons staying) instead of a 'guest' equivalent, per the language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_64b05ff9cda213e0338d",
   "sourceHash": "64b05ff9cda213e0338d332fd658d4133db7ec156a3440ef4ee523009ce5842f",
   "text": "3:30 PM之后到达者，将根据医生的时间安排，于下一个可预约日进行问诊。我们建议所有入住者据此规划行程，以免延误开始治疗疗程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 入住者 and 'healing program' as 治疗疗程, per the language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2809202c5ee71a23cff0",
   "sourceHash": "2809202c5ee71a23cff00bf0ea2f41a027affd50314f98ff33777f0a532028a5",
