   "sourceHash": "02ce2cfb2bb28f31dfee8628d93b39a507db35072882bf06f95dde0ebe374a90",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]付款方式：[[CLOSE_1]]入住者可使用信用卡/借记卡、银行转账或预订时指定的其他可接受方式付款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
