   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_512da5731ee1b93214ff",
   "sourceHash": "512da5731ee1b93214ff3d5635c56e00ec742b65d511335aa124b4063b58cedd",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]货币与费用：[[CLOSE_1]]所有款项均以指定货币结算。任何银行手续费、交易费用或汇率差额均由入住者承担。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
